abstract: >-
  Locked-artifact measurement harness and manuscript draft for a study of
  cross-mechanism authorization seams. Predictions, cases, arms, locks, and
  hashes are frozen before execution; the draft reports only discrepancies that
  survived reconciliation. This is a working preprint artifact, not a
  peer-reviewed result.
